  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 456285b583a6b3e4a8c5f253c8031b98, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ebf12f3726b43342a9acdab9ff8aa44, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0e57d37edb15d8448a334412f4f8aa1d, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 437ade22e4786044e8d3045905409fa5, type: 3}
  loadingTips:
  - "DYCIans in ABM turn ideas into thriving enterprises showcasing skills, we don\u2019t
    just study business, we build it."
  - HUMSS students use their voices to inspire and influence, becoming writers, and
    speakers known nationwide.
  - In STEM, DYCIans innovate beyond experiments, creating robots and breakthroughs
    that win in national and international arenas.
  - ICT students turn creativity into code build real-world apps and systems, proving
    digital excellence starts here.
  - In Maritime, DYCIans train through hands-on experiences, preparing to lead the
    seas with real certifications and skills.
  - DYCIans in ABM create ventures, seize opportunities, and bring ideas to life.
  - In ABM, DYCIans turn ambition into achievement creating, leading, and shaping
    the future of business.
  - DYCIans in ABM turn vision into impact, leading with purpose and achieving excellence.
  - DYCIans in HUMSS lead with purpose their words inspire, their actions empower,
    their ideas transform.
  - With bold voices and fearless ideas, DYCIans in HUMSS inspire minds and move
    hearts.
  - DYCIans in HUMSS inspire and influence, emerging as writers and speakers who
    shape the nation.
  - DYCIans in STEM push knowledge forward, exploring and innovating beyond limits.
  - Curiosity drives every DYCIans in STEM to turn challenges into discoveries.
  - DYCIans in STEM innovate beyond labs, creating award-winning robots and breakthroughs.
  - DYCIans in ICT fuse creativity and tech to design solutions that connect and
    advance society.
  - Skilled and creative, DYCIans in ICT design, code, and build innovations that
    matter.
  - DYCIans in ICT turn creativity into code, building apps and systems that define
    digital excellence.
  - DYCIans in Maritime gain the confidence to navigate challenges and command with
    strength.
  - On land or at sea, DYCIans in Maritime lead with discipline and skill.
  - DYCIans in Maritime train hands-on, earning real skills and certifications to
    lead confidently at sea.
  imageSwitchInterval: 4
  fadeDuration: 1
  spinSpeed: 50
